    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7770" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-φύρω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mix up, confound,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινάς τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					21.260c
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναμὶξ ἦν πάντα ὁμοίως ἀναπεφυρμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.103
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				250
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>defile,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάστιξι καὶ αἵματι ἀναπεφυρμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.157
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				742
			</span></i>.</div>
